<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8959" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cŏhortālis</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cort-</span></b> ), e, adj.
		cohors. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Pertaining to a cattle</i> or <i>poultry-yard</i> (freq. in Col.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">elsewhere very rare): aves,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
				1</span></i>
			, prooem. § 27; 6, 27, 4; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">8, 1, 3: gallina,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 8,
					2, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pullus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels.
					2, 18</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">officina,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					8, 3, 8</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ratio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 8,
					2, 6</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Pertaining to an imperial body - guard</i> (late
			Lat.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">officium, Cod. Th. 12, 58, 13: condicio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">ib. 16, 62, 3 al.</span></i>
			</div>
